This project is an independent .NET library for Kaspa. Its public types are
named as counterparts of NBitcoin (https://github.com/MetacoSA/NBitcoin).
NBitcoin is licensed under the MIT License. Copyright for NBitcoin is held
by its contributors, including Nicolas Dorier and Metaco SA.

NKaspa does not vendor NBitcoin source. Elliptic-curve operations are
intended to use the NBitcoin.Secp256k1 NuGet package, which is also under
the MIT License.

BLAKE2b is implemented in this repository from RFC 7693.
Kaspa address encoding follows the cashaddr-style bech32 used by Kaspa
(prefix kaspa, kaspatest, kaspasim, or kaspadev, and an 8-character checksum).
